rakuyomi-mangalib
=================

rakuyomi-mangalib is a modified version of rakuyomi
(https://github.com/tachibana-shin/rakuyomi), originally by hanatsumi and
tachibana-shin. It is based on upstream release 1.44.2 (commit 6e61856).

Modifications made in October 2026:
- token (access/refresh) authentication for MangaLib with automatic refresh
  (bundled Aidoku sources built from sources/);
- fixes in the Aidoku host (next-SDK status code, chapter metadata in
  get_page_list, persisting source defaults, settings import, sharing tokens
  between sources of one account);
- packaging as a separate plugin, rakuyomi-mangalib.koplugin, that can be
  installed next to rakuyomi (renamed at build time by fork/side_by_side.py:
  data dir, socket, settings keys, Lua module namespace); self-update is
  disabled in this package.

